  "scope": "E.94 evaluates the actual mu27 extension E/B3, including its ramified prime3 and inert prime17 norm and extension coefficients. The maximal ordinary and S-split genus quotients over B1 have relative groups C9^3+C3 and C9+C3. Their full ray, Kummer, prime-removal and normalizer maps are retained with all Smith transformations and inverses. The actual ordinary genus norm to E91 has kernel C3^2; ideal extension kills the exact old transvection kernel and factors through the old quotient, with JN=NJ=3. The S-genus norm is -x modulo3 and its normalizer action is G=I, H=[[1,3],[2,1]]. The actual noncyclic S-class coinvariant quotient proves that the previous cyclic deck-module premise fails after this base change. The full upper class groups, the old transvection and prime triple, the eventual exponent h and the particular unit-norm coset remain active.",
